{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> <br>IMPORTANT : Each run lasts 20 real-time minutes, but exploring the world, uncovering its secrets, and realizing what was possible all along can keep you discovering for much longer.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924170/extras/2f0731a0a508e93c78128d8cda091194.poster.avif?t=1773813327\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924170/extras/2f0731a0a508e93c78128d8cda091194.webm?t=1773813327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924170/extras/2f0731a0a508e93c78128d8cda091194.mp4?t=1773813327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternal Afternoon</strong> is a poetic walking sim about wasting time before the end of the world. You play as Sasha, a 10-year-old boy wandering his neighborhood in the final minutes before a giant black wave swallows everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924170/extras/1d4ff12ced06586ea2b80dfe56b30705.avif?t=1773813327\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924170/extras_big/1d4ff12ced06586ea2b80dfe56b30705.webp?t=1773813327 width=1560 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro nostalgic visuals &amp; authentic atmosphere</strong> \u2013 a suburban block in the summer of 2001, recreated with care. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A chilling meditation on time, death, and the inevitable</strong> \u2013 experience the quiet dread of a world that ends in twenty minutes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story through exploration</strong> \u2013 uncover small moments, side quests, and fragments of mystery woven into the neighborhood. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built with replayability and speedrun in mind</strong> \u2013 no save system, no upgrades; your only progress is knowledge of how the world works and how everything connects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Black Wave is the True Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924170/94972b1a97235592e93035dcf81001425074cc7d.jpg"},{"name":"Death by Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924170/30d09eb39e1e910248bda2bff4be5999c806900c.jpg"},{"name":"Cheat Death Itself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924170/754e6d8dd66c9e0acb0ea9670a35d2fa0294302d.jpg"},{"name":"Use a Pixelated Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924170/50c9513676724fbba8dc840dafe7f9224f4cb67b.jpg"},{"name":"Error 0x000001EA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924170/9143154621cfda0ae73a84909239e853889053d2.jpg"},{"name":"SPEEDRUNNER!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924170/bb3eb070d955149d4cf54f4edc0dd4d0cbea421a.jpg"},{"name":"0x000003EA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924170/5b1e18ad8c0a56f404c9d9319c6e94a332eea71f.jpg"},{"name":"Survive The Big Delete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924170/84ffc76700d6aef3c385152a01c3215887323ef3.jpg"},{"name":"The Heart Of The Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924170/6fff949a7dec559f3c910051d1ab819b64351be3.jpg"},{"name":"Error 0x000002EA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcomm